DESCRIPTION:Building confidence in your abilities is key to navigating set
 backs and staying motivated as a researcher. This workshop will explore s
 trategies for developing self-efficacy in research\, including goal-setti
 ng and tools for overcoming common challenges. Join us to reflect on your
  growth\, build resilience\, and strengthen your confidence as a research
 er.
DURATION:PT1H30M
